WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.670
Near the end of the Eastern Han dynasty,

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.750
Liu Bei was forced from Xinye to the south
by Cao Cao's offensive.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:11.080
<b>UIL</b>

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:12.750
In addition to his army,
this flight included many of Liu Bei's subjects,

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.330
but progress was slow due to their great numbers,
and it was clear that, sooner or later,

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:20.290
they'd be caught by the troops
Cao Cao had dispatched.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.040
Some of Liu Bei's men advised that he leave
the commoners behind to hasten their march,

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.170
but he obstinately refused.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.710
Stating: To achieve a great thing,
one must regard people as fundamental.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:37.080
The benevolent Liu Bei was ever
thinking of the populace.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.920
And in the present too, there is a singer who is
sending her heart out to the populace.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.210
What it is that you're singing for...

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.540
Until you find out, it won't make the grade.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:50.040
With the words of world-class DJ Kido weighing on her,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.290
Eiko deepened her friendship with street musician
Nanami, whom she met on a sidewalk.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:55.880
However...

00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:02.540
Ta-da! I'm the idol band Azalea's bassist
and vocalist: Nanami Kuon.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:09.210
Nanami is a member of Azalea, who are competing
in the 100,000 Likes Project alongside Eiko.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.210
<b>Likes received!</b>

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.210
<b>GUARANTEED SLOT</b>

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:13.630
You must follow all my instructions
on your dress, songs, and choreography.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:18.130
Nanami was troubled by the policies
of her producer, Karasawa.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.830
I no longer want to sing Karasawa's songs.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:26.130
But Azalea is no longer just about us three.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.460
For the sake of Nanami, who was feeling hurt,

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:32.920
and all those like her, the populace,
Eiko decided to...

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.170
I'm gonna sing!

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.960
That act signified that Eiko had
ascended to a new stage.

