<i>What kinda face is that?</i>

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.460
<i>I'm a wimpy ordinary Joe through and through.</i>

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.540
But...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.000
I will represent those guys.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.630
I will represent those guys.

