00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.630
<i>I wonder if he can tell I'm shaking?</i>

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:46.290
<i>Either way, it's excitement I'm trembling with.</i>

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.830
Up first, Sekitoba Kung Fu!

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.960
And second up, Kabetaijin!

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.500
Ready, fight!

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:55.080
<b><i>ya</i></b>

