00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:24.170
Just the way I am, I'll extend my winning streak

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:26.170
Then I'll stand at the peak!

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:28.750
That's a wrap!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.670
Now, it's time to pick a winner!

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:40.460
Put your hands up for the rapper you-

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.710
The victory is yours.

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:01.130
Thanks.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:08.170
The winner is Kabetaijin!

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.670
Simply amazing...

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.460
Kabe was brilliant.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:31.000
No longer that Ah-Meng from Wu, eh?

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.670
What's that mean?

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:34.710
Lü Meng, right?

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:35.710
"Lu"?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:39.830
The Wu general, Lü Meng,
was lacking in scholarly skills.

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:44.000
But he studied hard and became more
intelligent than the tacticians around him,

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.000
much to everyone's amazement.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:49.290
Ah, Kabe's rapping certainly did become more...

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.580
What word am I looking for?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.670
"Vibes," right?

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.250
Yeah! The vibes were on a whole new level!

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.920
A scholar you've not seen for three days
should be looked at with fresh eyes.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:03.750
Or, one who works hard daily will make
astonishing progress in even just three days...

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.830
<b>Kido</b>

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.830
<b>It's done</b>

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.630
in simpler terms.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.830
And now, it is your turn, Eiko.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.500
<i>I wonder if I can become like that too?</i>

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.540
<i>Someone who'll astound people
when they see me again.</i>

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.920
<i>That kind of singer...</i>

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:30.420
What is it?

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.580
It's nothing.

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.250
<i>I...</i>

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:36.960
<i>will!</i>

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:39.630
You showed up.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.290
Let's do this.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:45.420
It seems you're now ready to dance atop my plate.

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:47.420
Well then, let's begin.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.130
Okay!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:57.540
It's moot now, but is it okay to be
recording this late in the game?

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:01.250
Just you watch.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.130
Eiko, I'm gonna play the song,

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.210
so start singing on the second pass
if you're up for it.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:07.670
Got it!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:25.040
<i>Well, this is Steve Kido, a man who
competes on the world stage.</i>

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.500
<i>He ain't esteemed for nothing.</i>

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.750
<i>Wow!</i>

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.920
<i>Did I really write this song?</i>

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:38.460
<i>I wanna sing!</i>

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.710
<i>I can't wait to try singing it!</i>

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.330
Seems I lost the bet, huh?

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.000
Oh? And yet you seem to be in a fine mood.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:52.000
Well, being able to work on
something good feels great.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.500
But I sure do hate losing.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.000
Then, next time you compete,

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:01.000
I recommend you draw your opponent
into your chosen battlefield.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.330
Seize the initiative, do not have it seized from you.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.880
When I proposed our wager,

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:11.630
you ended up having not-so-small
expectations for Eiko out of the gate.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:18.000
Letting your opponent decide the terms of a bet is like
stepping into a battlefield that is favorable to them.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:22.830
Upon hearing Eiko's song,
you were sure to take on the job.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:26.330
Of that, I was thoroughly convinced.

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.880
It's easy to say whatever you want after the fact.

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:34.040
Eiko, I'm starting the second pass.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:45.500
I'm thinking of giving up on being a singer.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.420
I shall be your tactician.
I'm thinking of giving up on being a singer.<b></b>

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.250
I shall be your tactician.
Why not sing that song?<b></b>

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:47.670
I want even way more people to hear me sing!
Why not sing that song?<b></b>

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.170
I want even way more people to hear me sing!
You're missing your own voice.<b></b>

