Wanna play together?
You're missing your own voice.<b></b>

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.330
I'm going to sing!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.250
<i>Put everything...</i>

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.000
<i>into it.</i>

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:01.710
Master!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:04.000
Master Kongming!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:11.540
Master, this is no time to be dozing off for a nap!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.420
<i>Have I...</i>

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:19.130
<i>returned home?</i>

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.920
Liu Bei is waiting at the entrance!

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.670
This is his third visit, you know?

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.290
Today, he's saying he won't leave until you meet with him.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.210
<i>Liu Bei...
</i>Today, he's saying he won't leave until you meet with him.<b></b>

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:28.960
<i>My lord...</i>

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.040
<i>Now I see...</i>

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.500
<i>I'm reliving memories of days long past.</i>

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.790
<i>Who shall be first to awaken from the grand dream?</i>

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:42.630
<i>I know well of my everyday life</i>

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:45.540
<i>I've had my fill of spring sleep in my thatched cottage</i>

