<i>My lord...</i>

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:18.210
That is quite a soothing melody.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.960
Master Kongming, we meet at last!

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.380
I'm a bit embarrassed...

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:27.630
It's a playful song I learned as a young child.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.000
My feeling of anxiety for the people,
and for the country,

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.540
