00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.380
Something akin to an incurable disease
is constantly gnawing away at me.

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.670
The sorrow of the populace blankets the land.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:52.790
I would like to spread a just cause across the land,
and create peace throughout the world!

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.420
Master Kongming, please assist me.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.500
